# ==============================================================================
# DataNova AI — Frontend Environment Configuration (Production)
# ==============================================================================
# In production, set this environment variable in your frontend hosting dashboard
# (e.g. Vercel, Netlify, Cloudflare Pages, Render Static Sites, or Docker build arg).
